      "updated": 1790930172269,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AREA 7 — moving on. There is no approve-all, anywhere on this screen: a bulk approve is how human review turns into a\nrubber stamp. The only batch that was considered — “approve the ones I have read” — is not drawn, because reading would\nfirst have to become an act the screen can see.",
